{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111918","id":2937105024,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6vEKqA","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111918","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111918.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111918.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111918","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111918/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111918/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111918/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/6cfaee037a610031e0d572c36e75bd17ff120845","number":111918,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"MSVC: Check `catalog_productSemanticVersion` instead of `catalog_productDisplayVersion`","user":{"login":"benji-sws","id":1223494,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMjM0OTQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1223494?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benji-sws","html_url":"https://github.com/benji-sws","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benji-sws/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benji-sws/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benji-sws/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benji-sws/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benji-sws/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benji-sws/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benji-sws/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benji-sws/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benji-sws/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Currently, when you have an Insiders (pre-release) version of Visual Studio 2026 installed, you will get the following error when trying to build Godot (or at least, I did when I tried that):\r\n```\r\nValueError: invalid literal for int() with base 10: ' Insiders [11116':\r\n1>    File \"C:\\Users\\user\\Git\\godot\\SConstruct\", line 668:\r\n1>      cc_version = methods.get_compiler_version(env)\r\n1>    File \"C:\\Users\\user\\Git\\godot\\methods.py\", line 734:\r\n1>      ret[\"major\"] = int(sem_ver[0])\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis is because the build script currently checks the `catalog_productDisplayVersion` property of the newest version of Visual Studio currently installed, including pre-release versions. While for most stable releases this property actually is set as the semantic version, for the Insiders versions this version is set as `Insiders [xxx.yyy]`.\r\nRunning `vswhere.exe -latest -prerelease -products * -requires Microsoft.Component.MSBuild -utf8` gives some version strings which could work better as semantic versions, especially `catalog_productSemanticVersion`  since it actually follows the `x.y.z[-suffix]` format:\r\n```\r\ninstallationName: VisualStudioPreview/18.0.0-insiders+11116.177\r\ninstallationPath: C:\\Program Files\\Microsoft Visual Studio\\18\\Insiders\r\ninstallationVersion: 18.0.11116.177\r\nproductPath: C:\\Program Files\\Microsoft Visual Studio\\18\\Insiders\\Common7\\IDE\\devenv.exe\r\nisComplete: 1\r\nisLaunchable: 1\r\nisPrerelease: 1\r\nisRebootRequired: 0\r\ndisplayName: Visual Studio Community 2026\r\ndescription: Everything you need to build modern apps – free for you, built for impact.\r\nchannelId: VisualStudio.18.Preview\r\nchannelUri: https://aka.ms/vs/18/insiders/channel\r\ninstalledChannelId: VisualStudio.18.Preview\r\ncatalog_buildBranch: d18.0\r\ncatalog_buildVersion: 18.0.11116.177\r\ncatalog_expirationDate: 12/05/2025 17:00:00 +00:00\r\ncatalog_id: VisualStudioPreview/18.0.0-insiders+11116.177\r\ncatalog_includeBuildVersionInDisplayVersion: True\r\ncatalog_localBuild: build-lab\r\ncatalog_manifestName: VisualStudioPreview\r\ncatalog_manifestType: installer\r\ncatalog_productDisplayVersion: Insiders [11116.177]                        <--- Not a semantic version right now\r\ncatalog_productLine: Dev18\r\ncatalog_productLineVersion: 18\r\ncatalog_productMilestone: Insiders\r\ncatalog_productMilestoneIsPreRelease: True\r\ncatalog_productName: Visual Studio\r\ncatalog_productPatchVersion: 0\r\ncatalog_productRelease: RTW\r\ncatalog_productSemanticVersion: 18.0.0-insiders+11116.177                  <--- Semantic version with suffix\r\ncatalog_requiredEngineVersion: 4.0.2153.56108\r\nproperties_channelManifestId: VisualStudio.18.Preview/18.0.0-insiders+11116.177\r\nproperties_includeRecommended: 0\r\n[some mostly irrelevant and empty lines removed]\r\n```","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":205417413,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMDU0MTc0MTM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:windows","name":"platform:windows","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com